cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Ghost Scale Simulation
message: >-
  If you use this software or its results, please cite both this repository and
  the companion preprint.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Haskins
    given-names: Abraham
repository-code: "https://github.com/EmotiveAutomaton/ghost-scale-sim"
abstract: >-
  A computational active-inference model of how an observer infers the goal
  behind an artifact, what happens to that inference when the artifact was
  generated by a process with no goal, and what an honest or dishonest
  provenance signal does to the outcome. Companion code to "Art as an
  Algorithmic Virus".
keywords:
  - active-inference
  - theory-of-mind
  - ai-provenance
  - model-collapse
  - computational-model
  - pomdp
license: MIT
license-url: "https://github.com/EmotiveAutomaton/ghost-scale-sim/blob/master/LICENSE"
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "Art as an Algorithmic Virus"
  authors:
    - family-names: Haskins
      given-names: Abraham
  doi: 10.5281/zenodo.19407789
  year: 2026
